description: Trigger ONLY when the user asks to upgrade XDR endpoints (agents) or
  check which endpoint versions an endpoint is eligible to upgrade to. Covers getting
  upgrade-eligible versions and executing the upgrade, with mandatory endpoint_id
  resolution and platform filtering. Do not use for isolation, script execution, support
  files, file/process response, or exception-rule review.
